.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE CREATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute create \- Create a governed Attribute definition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute create [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a governed Attribute definition
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --key
Stable machine key (immutable after creation)
.TP
.B --name
Display name
.TP
.B --type
Supported Attribute type
Choices: single_select, multi_select, boolean
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
